  explanation:
    en: "The King of Ski Jumping. For years, the entire country stopped breathing
      when he was in the air. 'Le\u0107 Adam, le\u0107!'"
    native: "Kr\xF3l skok\xF3w narciarskich. Przez lata ca\u0142y kraj wstrzymywa\u0142
